Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.55,0:00:10.99,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:14.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.41,0:00:15.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.81,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I caught you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:24.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,A sadism trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:26.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I've made some poisoned apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.08,0:00:28.25,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.26,Default,JAHJI,0,0,0,,We're going to have Lady Doux hand \Nthese out in a human village.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.73,0:00:35.85,Default,JAHJI,0,0,0,,Once Lady Doux sees the humans \Nwho eat these writhe in agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:41.14,Default,JAHJI,0,0,0,,she should awaken to her demonic\Ninstinct: a sadistic heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.14,0:00:42.64,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:47.11,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Looting, sadism, destruction, killing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:53.08,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Every evil impulse or desire is \Na demon's justice and instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:57.28,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux should have those impulses \Nand desires within her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.18,0:01:00.28,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:02.54,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Let's not waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.11,0:01:05.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! We will take \Nthese for your next trial—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.51,0:01:07.72,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm going somewhere wearing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:11.00,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes, you are. It looks great on you, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.03,0:01:16.23,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So cute! You're the cutest \Nin the world, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.03,0:02:54.52,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Divine Messenger Is\N Too Much Trouble!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.16,0:02:54.52,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DIVINE MESSENGER IS\N TOO MUCH TROUBLE!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:57.72,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! This isn't some field trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.72,0:02:59.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why is she wearing that hood?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:02.49,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that. This \Nis for her protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:04.24,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.59,0:03:06.24,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Here, Lady Doux. Take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They look yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.05,0:03:12.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes, but these are no ordinary \Napples. They're poisoned...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:15.21,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! I just said they're poisoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.21,0:03:16.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Poisoned apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.90,0:03:20.13,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They are {\i1}not{\i0} delicious. \NThey are meant to torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Tor...ment...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:26.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You just need to hand these \Nout to the humans, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:29.56,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Once you're able to do that, you'll \Nbecome a full-fledged demon, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:32.52,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:39.49,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This time... This time, \Nit'll absolutely work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.49,0:03:42.44,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux just has to hand these \Npoisoned apples out to the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:45.37,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then she'll naturally awaken \Nto her sadistic instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:51.37,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Any demon would be elated to \Nwatch a lower being suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.37,0:03:52.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:54.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Ah! Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.39,0:03:58.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're not allowed to save anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:01.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.27,0:04:06.73,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is the village where \Nyour trial will take place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:11.77,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I've chosen a very poor village to \Nheighten your chances of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You will say these are normal apples
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:16.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and have them eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.09,0:04:17.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:22.03,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You absolutely must not tell them they \Nare poisoned or that you are a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:24.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:24.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:25.83,Default,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Please have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:29.27,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Please have mercy, Lord Aeshma!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:40.05,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.50,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,A village like this has a ruler?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:46.28,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,At this rate, my daughter \Nwill starve to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.28,0:04:48.68,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Please show us some grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:50.50,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.53,0:04:53.39,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:56.61,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.39,0:05:04.92,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.77,0:05:13.79,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,I am Aeshma, a divine messenger, the one \Nprotecting your village from the demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:19.29,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,In return, you're offering \Nme all of your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.29,0:05:22.42,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Wasn't that our deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:25.17,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That guy's a divine messenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:27.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No. Divine messengers,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.75,0:05:33.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,the angels, live in heaven and have \Nwings and a halo over their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,What's a halo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.42,0:05:39.31,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,They have a donut-shaped thing \Nfloating above their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.54,0:05:41.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A donut?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.15,0:05:45.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,So someone without wings or a halo \Nlike him is not a divine messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:46.55,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:50.94,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,No divine messenger would abandon a \Nstarving child to fulfill his own greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.70,Default,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,That's right! We can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.39,0:06:02.53,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,We definitely showed up at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.53,0:06:05.11,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'd like to avoid any \Ntrouble during the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.48,0:06:08.60,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, let's give up on \Nthis village and try another...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:15.42,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Traitors will not be shown \Nmercy. They will be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.25,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Now, who wants to be punished first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:20.81,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Does anyone want an apple?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.81,0:06:23.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please learn some restraint!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.17,0:06:26.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We clearly shouldn't be \Nbutting in right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.54,0:06:29.66,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Wh-Who the heck are you? \NWhere'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.66,0:06:30.82,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.09,0:06:33.83,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking the literal direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.33,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,I'm asking where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:39.02,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux lives in the demon castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.02,0:06:39.96,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,The demon castle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.96,0:06:40.75,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:44.25,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Th-Then are you a demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.53,0:06:48.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi told me I \Nwasn't allowed to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.63,0:06:50.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You basically just admitted it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:53.14,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,What's a demon like you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:55.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm gonna give out apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.10,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:59.45,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Those apples! May we have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:03.65,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Who gave you permission to speak?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.65,0:07:05.15,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,We won't let you hurt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:06.65,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.97,0:07:10.65,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I wondered how this would turn \Nout, but it's not going so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:14.66,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, Lady Doux! Give the \Nhumans the poisoned apples
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.95,0:07:17.66,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,and awaken your demonic instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:20.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Do you like torment apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.17,Default,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,Torment...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:26.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I guess these are torment apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.92,0:07:30.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I've only eaten yummy apples before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.39,0:07:32.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Do you like torment apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:37.43,Default,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,No... I don't want any torment...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.43,0:07:38.81,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.81,0:07:41.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! Don't give up so soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.18,0:07:51.70,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Man, I love every moment \NI torment these traitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:57.33,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,I love it so much! I don't \Nknow what to do with myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:58.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.62,0:07:59.87,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:01.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Then I'll give you these.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.94,0:08:03.29,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.89,0:08:04.63,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:09.30,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,I guess you fear me \Neven if you're a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:13.01,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,I'll spare your life \Nfor being so obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.84,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Hey, this is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.84,0:08:23.77,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd let \Nthose traitors have these!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.67,0:08:31.03,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GUUURGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:35.78,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,My stomach... Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.06,0:08:37.91,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,What are these?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:40.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They're torment apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.41,0:08:46.92,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,You tricked me?! You \Nwon't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.14,0:08:48.34,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.42,0:08:53.97,Default,AESHMA,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:55.49,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,It's Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:59.75,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I applied a teleportation function \Non the hood for emergencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.75,0:09:01.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,It looks like it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.44,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Those travelers defeated \Nthe divine messenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:15.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm? Divine messenger?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.44,0:09:17.55,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This guy's an angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:20.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, no. He was just calling himself that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.87,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:27.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes. Look. He has no halo or wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:29.47,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Hm... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:32.68,Default,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,We've been freed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:35.41,Default,VILLAGER C,0,0,0,,Hooray for our hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:36.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:39.64,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Looks like the trial was \Nalso a huge success, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.64,0:09:41.14,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,How so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.14,0:09:45.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We demons are being treated \Nas heroes by these humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.18,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But she was able to hand out \Nthose apples, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:52.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Then perhaps Doux's sadistic instinct has \Nbegun to awaken within her heart, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:55.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here! Have a yummy one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:56.94,Default,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:02.58,Default,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.63,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.63,0:10:06.85,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I guess the trial failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.29,0:10:07.96,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:13.46,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Villagers! I am the Demon King Ahriman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:16.67,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This village is now under my protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:21.22,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I will make sure you are not eaten \Nby monsters and even give you food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.54,0:10:24.71,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,In return, you will work for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:29.48,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'll treat you better than \Nthis "divine messenger."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:33.36,Default,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Ahriman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:35.23,Default,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Ahriman!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:37.36,Default,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Lady Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.24,Default,VILLAGERS,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:42.74,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well, all's well that ends well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Well!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:45.90,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:53.55,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DIVINE MESSENGER (THE REAL ONE)\NIS TOO HOT-HEADED!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.17,0:10:53.55,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Divine Messenger (The Real \NOne) Is Too Hot-Headed!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:02.53,Default,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,And then they...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:07.70,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:12.03,Default,ANGEL A,0,0,0,,We have come to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:13.96,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,We are angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.96,0:11:15.69,Default,ANGEL C,0,0,0,,Essentially, we are divine messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.13,0:11:20.24,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,What is the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.24,0:11:23.49,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,We're sick of divine messengers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:25.51,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,But we're real ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.51,0:11:28.25,Default,ANGEL A,0,0,0,,You literally saw us come \Ndown from heaven just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:31.69,Default,ANGEL C,0,0,0,,We heard that demons have \Ntaken over this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:34.38,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,We will help you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:39.37,Default,VILLAGER B,0,0,0,,You say that, but we don't exactly \Nhate our lives right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:42.26,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,It's much better than with \Nthat last divine messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:45.89,Default,VILLAGER C,0,0,0,,Mr. Ahriman and Ms. Jahi are pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:48.39,Default,DAUGHTER,0,0,0,,Doux is kind and cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.62,0:11:51.39,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,Demons aren't that bad after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.39,0:11:53.90,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Of course demons are bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.40,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Those demons are tricking you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.87,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.30,0:12:01.87,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,We've prepared a better place and \Nbetter houses for all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.87,0:12:03.26,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,So shut up and come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.26,0:12:04.41,Default,VILLAGER A,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:05.91,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.15,0:12:07.66,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:10.16,Default,MOTHER,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:18.33,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,This is heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:21.94,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Unlike the demon world, this is a paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.94,0:12:25.14,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,in the sky where divine\Nmessengers, the angels, live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:29.33,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,Man, those villagers were weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:32.77,Default,ANGEL A,0,0,0,,They really didn't seem \Nto agree even in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.77,0:12:36.10,Default,ANGEL A,0,0,0,,but there's no way they could be \Nhappy being ruled by demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.34,0:12:40.53,Default,ANGEL C,0,0,0,,But Lord Mayu, please don't \Nresort to such force.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:41.99,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.21,0:12:44.82,Default,ANGEL C,0,0,0,,Why not? That was practically kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:46.28,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,That's not what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:54.29,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Why do we angels, divine messengers, \Nhave to sneak around hiding from demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:57.39,Default,ANGEL C,0,0,0,,I don't think we were exactly sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:59.58,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,The demons started this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.58,0:13:01.55,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,We might as well face them head-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.03,0:13:03.30,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I'll do it myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:07.93,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I'll defeat all the demons \Nand end this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.30,0:13:11.43,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Lord Mayu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:24.77,Default,DEMON SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.77,0:13:27.07,Default,DEMON SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,Please calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.32,Default,DEMON SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,This is bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.32,0:13:31.34,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.34,0:13:32.58,Default,DEMON SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Oh, Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:35.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why is His Majesty so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:39.27,Default,DEMON SOLDIER B,0,0,0,,Apparently, some angels stole away \Nsome slaves from his domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:43.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Angels?! They enrage His \NMajesty like nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.17,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We must quell his anger somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.48,0:13:47.76,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,If we let him continue, the \Ncastle will be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.76,0:13:50.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Hm? L-Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:54.81,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi, let's go draw outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:54.81,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SKETCHBOOK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.81,0:13:56.56,Default,DEMON SOLDIER A,0,0,0,,Lady Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.78,0:14:00.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,C-Can you go draw by yourself today?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:04.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty and I have an \Nurgent matter to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:07.82,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, His Majesty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:11.24,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay! Good luck at work!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.83,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You mustn't wander too far off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:16.43,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And make sure you come \Nhome before it gets dark!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.43,0:14:18.26,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:27.61,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"LET'S DRAW"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\N COMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: NAOKI YANAGISAWA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:32.57,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Colorful crayons
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.03,0:14:37.75,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,And some white paper
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.50,0:14:43.25,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's draw
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.71,0:14:48.59,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Let's draw all the things we love
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:54.18,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,A pointy mouth (Pointy, point, point)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.43,0:14:59.64,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,A wriggly stem (Wriggle, wriggle, wriggle)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:10.07,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Leaves that grow and grow
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:12.95,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,A hungry flower
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.58,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Some fluffy clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:20.12,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The sparkly sun
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.94,0:15:30.28,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I wonder who that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.86,0:15:35.16,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,You're in my way, stupid mongrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.16,0:15:37.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.10,0:15:41.00,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,You dumb kid! Don't get so close to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.56,0:15:44.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,We'll play again later, puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:47.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:48.55,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.10,0:15:58.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:16:01.11,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,R-Right. Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.66,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,What's a kid like you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.32,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,This is a dangerous forest \Nnear the demon castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:10.46,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,No kid should come here alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:12.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux comes here all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.36,0:16:15.47,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Huh? What're your parents doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.52,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Oh, fine. I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.52,0:16:22.90,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Though if I fly, the guys at \Nthe demon castle might spot me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.22,0:16:24.47,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,So I guess we're walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:25.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.93,0:16:27.75,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:29.25,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:32.47,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Just shut up and I'll \Nprotect you. Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:35.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,A donut!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.62,0:16:37.26,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I don't have any snacks with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:42.89,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Let's go! Don't wander off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:52.90,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,SKETCHBOOK
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:57.91,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Doux! Don't pull any pranks \Nat times like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:16:59.03,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.26,0:17:02.16,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Well, that did actually save us but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:03.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:06.54,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,But one wrong move, and you might've been \Nhurt. Then, we couldn't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.88,0:17:08.67,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Then if the demons show up...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.67,0:17:10.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They'll be really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:11.83,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:16.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They're always really nice to Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:20.06,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,No way! Demon's aren't nice to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.34,0:17:23.93,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,But Doux isn't human. Doux is a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:24.98,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:31.99,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Y-You're... a demon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.99,0:17:32.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:34.15,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,You tricked me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:36.78,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:40.66,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,So this is how demons do things!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:43.79,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm not gonna fall for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:46.79,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! A butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:51.31,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Take that! And that! And that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:53.30,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Butterfly!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:55.30,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.46,0:18:00.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.69,0:18:03.56,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Y-You're not bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.81,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,D-Dang...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.52,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,You can heal wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.52,0:18:12.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Did the ouchie fly away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.89,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I-It's not like it hurt \Nin the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.33,0:18:19.07,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hey, are you an angel, Big Brother Mayu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:22.03,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,B-Big Brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:24.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi told me about them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:30.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Angels live in the sky and \Nhave wings and donuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.04,0:18:34.37,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Th-This isn't a donut! It's a {\i1}halo{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.37,0:18:36.33,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So you can't eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:37.75,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.75,0:18:39.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:42.35,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,What're you drawing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:46.47,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,An angel. Because it's the \Nfirst time I've seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:47.35,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.55,0:18:53.96,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Man... you're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.99,0:18:56.58,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.58,0:18:58.36,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,You're a demon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.67,0:18:59.86,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.10,0:19:06.01,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Demons are supposed to be bad guys \Nwho fight us angels...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.08,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,but you keep helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.44,0:19:12.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You're fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.21,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.65,0:19:17.89,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Angels are trying to make \Nthe world peaceful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.89,0:19:20.47,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,so they don't get along with the \Ndemons, who keep doing bad things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.86,0:19:23.21,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Demons and angels used to fight every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:25.64,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,But now...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:30.96,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Now, demons do whatever they want while \Nangels sneak around helping people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.96,0:19:32.90,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,That doesn't solve anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:34.26,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,That's why...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.63,0:19:40.15,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I came here to defeat all the \Ndemons and put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:44.07,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Real fights mean hitting \Nyour opponent head-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:49.37,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I think... making up is the real fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:54.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So Doux wants make up with the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:58.97,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Th-That's not possible! \NAngels hate demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.97,0:20:01.48,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,and demons also hate us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:03.38,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Wait, this drawing...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.03,0:20:05.64,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux likes you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:06.89,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:12.02,Default,ANGEL D,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.02,0:20:15.02,Default,ANGEL A,0,0,0,,Lord Mayu! You mustn't be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.25,0:20:17.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Now there's lots of angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:21.65,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Then promise me, D-Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.88,0:20:25.66,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,I'm... I'm gonna be the \Nking of heaven someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.66,0:20:28.66,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,So you become the king \Nof the demon world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:32.24,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux is gonna be the king \Nof the demon world?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.24,0:20:36.82,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,W-Well, if you become king, \Nyou can do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.82,0:20:38.60,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.60,0:20:41.81,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Um, wh-when that happens, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:45.76,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,W-Well, it's a promise, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.31,0:20:51.02,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,When that happens, the angels \Nand demons can make up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:55.38,Default,MAYU,0,0,0,,Got it?! It's a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.71,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! A promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:05.80,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! We will bring back \Nthe people who were taken from us!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.80,0:21:06.90,Default,EXECS,0,0,0,,Without fail!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.90,0:21:09.16,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see... You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:11.54,Default,DEMONS,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.77,0:21:14.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.28,0:21:15.92,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:20.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's the matter, Your Majesty?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:24.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, Lady Doux?! Why's \Nthere an angel drawn here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.93,0:21:29.89,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa's birthday's soon. \NSo here's a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That didn't answer my question!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.38,0:21:36.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,His Majesty is absolutely \Nlivid because of the angels!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.44,0:21:37.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wivid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:39.19,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,{\i1}Livid{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.48,0:21:41.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,And this is just adding \Nfuel to the fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:46.32,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Your Majesty! Please calm down—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.32,0:21:48.26,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.45,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:53.91,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You drew this all for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.91,0:21:55.96,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Did I do good?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:59.50,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You did! You're the best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.81,0:22:02.20,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Rather than being angry \Nat the angel drawing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.20,0:22:05.51,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,his happiness from his birthday present...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:08.79,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Totally won this round!
